WEBVTT

00:04:29.823 --> 00:04:31.467
that it's possible to know.

00:04:32.451 --> 00:04:36.843
And worryingly, there's no consensus
about what it is.

00:04:37.232 --> 00:04:38.675
So, I'll tell you.

00:04:38.699 --> 00:04:39.730
(Laughter)

00:04:39.754 --> 00:04:42.245
But I'll have to backtrack a little first.

00:04:43.046 --> 00:04:45.069
Before the scientific revolution,

00:04:46.117 --> 00:04:49.129
they believed that everything
important, knowable,

00:04:49.153 --> 00:04:50.647
was already known,

00:04:50.671 --> 00:04:54.354
enshrined in ancient
writings, institutions

00:04:54.378 --> 00:04:57.414
and in some genuinely
useful rules of thumb --

00:04:57.438 --> 00:05:00.680
which were, however, entrenched as dogmas,